 "desc": "An isometric scene in two parts with a wall between them. On the left, the AI's session in Claude Code: hooks and permission rules refuse an edit of a locked file, a push, and a merge. In the gap in the wall, pre-commit checks each commit, merge, and push. A commit that passes goes on to the right; a commit that fails comes back refused. On the right, the main branch and the signed records: a merge into main needs a signed pass record, and a risky change also needs your signed approval.",
